<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>FILDERSTADT, Germany 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results at the $450,000 Filderstadt women's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) 3-6 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>5-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Judith Wiesner (Austria) 6-1 6-1</p>
</text>
